Component Functions

Camera Sensor: Detects visible cracks, tears, deformation, and other splice defects.
Vibration Sensor: Identifies abnormal vibration patterns associated with splice degradation.
Current/Load Sensor: Monitors changes in conveyor motor current and operating load.
ESP32/Controller: Collects and synchronizes data from all sensors.
Data Pre-processing: Removes noise and prepares sensor data for AI analysis.
AI/ML Model: Combines visual, vibration, and operational data using multimodal data fusion.
Splice Health Index: Represents the current condition of the conveyor-belt splice.
Failure-Risk Prediction: Estimates the risk of potential splice failure.
Maintenance Alert: Generates an early warning when abnormal degradation is detected.
Dashboard: Displays splice health, sensor values, risk status, and maintenance alerts.
